\]

The pressure-pressure difference is given by:

\[
\Delta P = \frac{m}{2100} \times 9.81 \text{ m/s}^2 \times h
\]

The pressure-pressure difference is given in Pascals (Pa) or Pascals-meter (Pa·m).

