2. **Determine the number of moles of electrons (n):**
   The balanced reaction is:  Zn(s) + Cu2+(aq) → Zn2+(i.c.°°°°°°°°°°°°°) + Cu(s)
   Zinc is oxidized from Zn to Zn2+, leaving 2 electrons.  Cu2+ is reduced to Cu, leaving 2 electrons. Thus, 2 moles of electrons are transferred.  So, n = 2.

