\[
\int_{-1}^{2} (x^2 + 2) \, dx.
\]


To evaluate this integral, we integrate the integrand with respect to \(x\):
\[
\int (x^2 + 2) \, dx = \frac{x^3}{3} + 2x + C.
\]

